<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;">DORY PH, INC.<br />
        {{#if finalNotice}}Final Notice{{else}}Notice{{/if}}: Low Deliveries in Your Service Area
    </h2>

    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

    <p>
        Pursuant to the Non-Activity of Partner Operations Policy stated under
        Memorandum No. 2025.10.033, partners are required to complete a minimum
        of ten (10) delivery transactions per month in each of their assigned
        service areas.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our records show that the service area(s) listed below recorded fewer
        than ten (10) delivered transactions in <strong>{{month}}</strong>:
    </p>

    <ul>
        {{#each areas}}
        <li><strong>{{this}}</strong></li>
        {{/each}}
    </ul>

    {{#if finalNotice}}
    <p>
        <strong>This is your final notice for the area(s) above.</strong> If
        they again record fewer than ten (10) delivered transactions next
        month, they will be removed from your partnership account, and orders
        from them will no longer be assigned to you. If every service area on
        your account is removed, your partnership account will be terminated.
    </p>
    {{else}}
    <p>
        Please increase your delivery activity in the area(s) above. If they
        continue to record fewer than ten (10) delivered transactions in the
        coming months, they may be removed from your partnership account.
    </p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>
        If you have questions about this notice, please reply to this email.
    </p>

    <br />
    <p>--<br />
        Regards,<br />
        <strong>Admin. Assistant</strong><br />
        Dory Ph, Inc.
    </p>
</body>

</html>
